 r←ReadCache file;cache;tie
 :If ⎕NEXISTS file
     :Trap 20 24
         tie←file ⎕FTIE 0
         cache←⎕FREAD tie 1
         r←'Loaded existing cache. Cache was created at ',⊃##.ISODateTime 13 ⎕NINFO file
     :Case 20
         r←'Cache file exists but could not be loaded. File exists but component does not.'
     :Case 24
         r←'Cache file exists but could not be loaded. File was already tied.'
     :EndTrap
     ⎕FUNTIE tie
     #.DCMS.GLOBAL.cache←cache   ⍝ Single-line update is safe across threads. Readers take snapshots to get complete cache view.
 :Else
     r←'Cache file does not exist. It will be created once the cache is built.'
 :EndIf
